Package: foopgp-hugowebsite
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, hugo, git, apache2, cron, goaccess, logrotate
Description: deployment tooling for the Friends of OpenPGP website
 Installs the machinery to serve foopgp.org from a Hugo site on a fresh host:
 an Apache virtual host, a cron job that pulls the site sources from codeberg
 (with a github mirror) and rebuilds public/ with Hugo when they change, and a
 goaccess statistics job. Everything runs as the www-data user.
 .
 It does NOT ship the website content itself. The site is a git clone that the
 update job bootstraps under /var/www/foopgp-hugowebsite/ on its first run
 (or when the operator triggers it) ; see /usr/share/doc/foopgp-hugowebsite.
